<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4836820501302629041..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Beware William Tell&#39;s Second Arrow</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><link rel='next' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default?start-index=26&amp;max-results=25'/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>39</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2836875237705041527</id><published>2009-07-16T10:09:28.664-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-16T10:09:28.664-06:00</updated><title type='text'>IHBF,&#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;Using the government to enact legisla...</title><content type='html'>IHBF,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Using the government to enact legislation that helps businesses and hurts “taxpayers,” (our only identity), was the guiding principal upon which this country was founded.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Perhaps not - from all acounts, the Founders knew all too well the dangers of unbridled government, and set up all those checks and balances to prevent it, which we seem to have discarded without a second thought. But you are exactly right in regards to our present situation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I voted for Obama, but he seems to have been turned from his purposes by all those voices around him whispering in his ears about noble reconciliation and monarchical clemency. The welfare for corporations and the kleptocratic bankers, the forgiveness of criminal activity and torture, the blind eyes turned to embezzlement and theft, this is NOT why I voted for the man....The more things change, the more they stay the same, as the French say. &amp;quot;Yes we can&amp;quot; - do WHAT, exactly? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Slogans will not pay my rent when the unemployment checks stop coming and I am no longer counted as unemployed. And I don&amp;#39;t expect the CEOs of those banks to give me any free rides in their corporate jets either.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I should change my pseudonym from Gulliver to &amp;quot;Permanently Nauseated.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thanks for your comments.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;L. Gulliver</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/2836875237705041527'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/2836875237705041527'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247760568664#c2836875237705041527' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2078107981"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 16, 2009 at 10:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-830473969575468204</id><published>2009-07-15T22:41:38.949-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-15T22:41:38.949-06:00</updated><title type='text'>“Whatever UBS gets, UBS deserves.” How churlish; i...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;“Whatever UBS gets, UBS deserves.”&lt;/i&gt; How churlish; it is the Swiss and American people who will “get” what UBS deserves, if anything, and nobody deserves to “get what they deserve” at the hands of the American government. But is that their greatest sin? Paying off a Congressman? Using the government to enact legislation that helps  businesses and hurts “taxpayers,” (our only identity), was the guiding principal upon which this country was founded.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/830473969575468204'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/830473969575468204'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247719298949#c830473969575468204' title=''/><author><name>I Hate Bobby Flay</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1404657108"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 15, 2009 at 10:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3762252558085184538</id><published>2009-07-15T19:35:22.671-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-15T19:35:22.671-06:00</updated><title type='text'>There has been a George Soros funded campaign to g...</title><content type='html'>There has been a George Soros funded campaign to get &amp;quot;sensible gun safety&amp;quot; laws passed in Switzerland.&lt;br /&gt;What a change from the days when I would read Halbrook&amp;#39;s prose in the American Rifleman, so envious of the Swiss people&amp;#39;s freedom.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Now it seems like it is turning into US.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That the Swiss did not really resist the scam by the Holocaust industry was another sign that the new Swiss are not like the old Swiss. No courage.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Today or tomorrow, attached to the Defense bill, the Matthew Shepard Hate Crime bill may pass the Senate.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I have to say I was shocked that a certain paleo-libertarian website did not even mention this bill.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;truthtellers.org Rev. Ted Pike&amp;#39;s website has done yeoman&amp;#39;s work to stop this Thought Crime juggernaut.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Needless to say James Dobson, &amp;quot;Ted&amp;#39;s in heaven now&amp;quot; speaking of Ted Bundy, Gary Bauer and other pantloads, did nothing to stop it either.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We are finding our voices CUT OFF from discussion forums put out by mainstream media. They DO NOT want the lemmings to hear our message.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It could get worse, you&amp;#39;ve heard of Obama&amp;#39;s Czar for the internet?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Read it and be afraid, be very afraid:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;GAG THE INTERNET! - New York Post&lt;br /&gt;AN OBAMA OFFICIAL&amp;#39;S FRIGHTENING BOOK ABOUT CURBING FREE SPEECH ONLINE&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.nypost.com/seven/07112009/postopinion/opedcolumnists/gag_the_internet__178749.htm</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/3762252558085184538'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/3762252558085184538'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247708122671#c3762252558085184538' title=''/><author><name>Benjamin Martin</name><uri>http://gunbanobama.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-443044413"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 15, 2009 at 7:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1440347847711945909</id><published>2009-07-15T19:05:09.587-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-15T19:05:09.587-06:00</updated><title type='text'>LG,  Thanks for the update.  Well, it only goes to...</title><content type='html'>LG,  Thanks for the update.  Well, it only goes to show that some of the biggest criminals to ever cast their corrupt shadow over Mordor on the Pottomac spewed forth from Texas.  Thats not something to be proud about.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/1440347847711945909'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/1440347847711945909'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247706309587#c1440347847711945909' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 15, 2009 at 7:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7246128457206589811</id><published>2009-07-15T00:52:34.356-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-15T00:52:34.356-06:00</updated><title type='text'>MoT,&#xa;&#xa;Don&amp;#39;t feel too sorry for UBS First Bosto...</title><content type='html'>MoT,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Don&amp;#39;t feel too sorry for UBS First Boston. After Republican Senator Phil Gramm had engineered the midnight removal of all regulations and standards from the banking industry and its menagerie of exotic &amp;quot;derivatives&amp;quot; creations in 1999, (which he still maintains strenuously had nothing to do with the present credit collapse,) he retired from the Gubbamint and was hired by UBS at a salary which UBS and Phil Gramm choose not to disclose. One hand washes the other, so to speak, as it has always done down through the sewers of history.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Whatever UBS gets, UBS deserves. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Unfortunately, Phil Gramm gets nothing, except to keep his salaries, commissions, stock options, perks, expense accounts, and cash, which is no doubt deposited for him in UBS accounts.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Possibly, the directoral board of UBS consists of forty members, and Phil Gramm&amp;#39;s real name is Ali Baba.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/7246128457206589811'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/7246128457206589811'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247640754356#c7246128457206589811' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2078107981"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 15, 2009 at 12:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-647843169393263687</id><published>2009-07-14T22:04:04.630-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-14T22:04:04.630-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, again, bless you. I&amp;#39;ve been thinking of ...</title><content type='html'>Will, again, bless you. I&amp;#39;ve been thinking of Switzerland&amp;#39;s example lately. Now that the EU is determined to strangle the last vestige of national sovereignty left in &amp;#39;old Europe&amp;#39;... and disarm its citizens... &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Molon_Labe!&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;molon labe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/647843169393263687'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/647843169393263687'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247630644630#c647843169393263687' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-625227811"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 14, 2009 at 10:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5879192561306228310</id><published>2009-07-14T06:44:52.219-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-14T06:44:52.219-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Still keeping my eye on what the shakedown artists...</title><content type='html'>Still keeping my eye on what the shakedown artists, i.e. &amp;quot;lawyers&amp;quot;, are trying to do to UBS.  How ironic that the DOJ would pursue monies in foreign accounts but turn a blind eye in its defense of torture or the misspent wealth of common Americans in foreign wars of aggression.  Yes yes... the hypocrisy moves forward as usual.  Move along now folks just new lies for old.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/5879192561306228310'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/5879192561306228310'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247575492219#c5879192561306228310' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 14, 2009 at 6:44 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3338026471084642135</id><published>2009-07-14T05:33:59.502-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-14T05:33:59.502-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Wiedenfeld,&#xa;&#xa;I cannot explain why it is that d...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Wiedenfeld,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I cannot explain why it is that down through history Jews have been picked upon by the populations they lived among. Anti-Jewish writings are vast and extensive over the past 2,000 years. Even Shakespeare created the caricature Shylock to represent &amp;quot;The Jew,&amp;quot; and many of the Founding Fathers of this country also wrote in highly unfavorable terms about Jews. It was not only the Nazis who felt this way - they just represented the syndrome taken to incomprehensible and spectacular criminal lengths. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(I personally believe the Shoah had just as much to do with stealing the money, homes, and property of the Jews of Europe as with hatred of them. A dead rich man has no voice in the disposition of his property. And the Nazi Party was an immense criminal enterprise, which stole gold bullion and diamonds and money and art treasures from conquered nations in vast quantities that would boggle the mind.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We can propose many theories about this phenomenon. Certainly, the writings of many rabbis in the Talmud down through the centuries are even more vicious and derogatory towards Goyim than the writings of all those Goyim towards Jews. Which side started this war of words I do not know. As for which tribe is to blame, the answer might be none of the above - it could be the Khazars, whose existence is denied by some.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As I have mentioned before on this blog, the Polish immigrant Jews in Germany, (descendants of the Khazars,) who had fled there from Poland following their treachery to their host country during the battle of Warsaw in 1920, were utterly despised even by the native (as in 300+ years of residence) Jews of Germany, who referred to them as &amp;quot;Galizianer Judenschwein.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In the 1920&amp;#39;s 300,000 Polish Jews also fled east into Russia, expecting a warm welcome from their hero Uncle Joe Stalin, whose side they had taken in the Battle of Warsaw, but who had them all shot -every one - as soon as they crossed the border.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Post-WWII those Polish Jews who had somehow survived the war in Germany (I could make reference to some rodent or insect species, but will refrain,) were so much trouble to the American Occupation Authority that they were rounded up and held in a concentration camp in Hamburg prior to forcible deportation to Palestine from 1945 to 1947. (They have since become the corrupt Zionist criminals who now rule Israel.) Yes indeed - not only did Roosevelt blatantly steal $229 million of Jewish money deposited in America, but America operated the last Jewish concentration camp (but without gas chambers) in Germany. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Polish Jews in Germany could not be sent back to Poland - that was tried, and resulted in Catholic Polish massacres of their returning Jewish countrymen - the last pogroms in history were in Poland in 1946. Today you will find there are more Jews living in Germany, the fountainhead of Nazism, than in the Nazi-conquered nation of Poland. (118,000 vs. 25,000. Even Hungary has more, at 49,000.) Something to wonder at, don&amp;#39;t you think? As I said, it was not only the Nazis who felt this way towards those &amp;quot;certain&amp;quot; Jews.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;However, in conclusion, if I was Jewish, I would make every effort, not only to research every discriminatory atrocity ever perpetrated against my people, and to commemorate these in religious holidays, but to find out WHY it keeps happening again, and again, and again, and again, over thousands of years and across continents, and in places where an entire host of religions have prevailed. What is that for a phenomenon? It is quite astonishing.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Yours truly,&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/3338026471084642135'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/3338026471084642135'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247571239502#c3338026471084642135' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2078107981"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 14, 2009 at 5:33 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-586170811838423301</id><published>2009-07-14T04:03:24.532-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-14T04:03:24.532-06:00</updated><title type='text'>These figures are from my Casey Investment newslet...</title><content type='html'>These figures are from my Casey Investment newsletter:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;==================================&lt;br /&gt;Simone Wapler compared government debt to government gold. The United States has gold worth about $241 billion, she reports. Its official national debt is $11.5 trillion. That gives it a debt/gold ratio of 48 – meaning; the feds have 48 times as much debt as gold.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;Britain is even worse. Prime Minister, then Chancellor, Gordon Brown sold much of England&amp;#39;s gold at the worst possible moment – about 10 years ago. This leaves the island with only $9 billion worth of gold compared to $1,274 &lt;br /&gt;billion of government debt – a ratio of 1 to 139. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But Japan is the worst of all. It has $23 billion worth of gold and $7.3 trillion of government debt, for a ratio of 1 to 323. (Of course, Japan has vast holdings of dollars too!)&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;What nation has the best gold/debt ratio? Switzerland. It has only twice as much in government debt as it has in gold. &lt;br /&gt;===================================&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/586170811838423301'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/586170811838423301'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247565804532#c586170811838423301' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2078107981"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 14, 2009 at 4:03 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4255028071878448967</id><published>2009-07-13T18:44:48.012-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-13T18:44:48.012-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I largely agree with Mr. Gulliver&amp;#39;s point that...</title><content type='html'>I largely agree with Mr. Gulliver&amp;#39;s point that the political exploitation, financial extortion and &amp;#39;victimization&amp;#39; culture that emanated from the Shoah industry as ably documented by Norman Finkelstein in his book &amp;quot;The Holocaust Industry&amp;quot; has tainted the memory of the unspeakable, horrible WWII democide, but I&amp;#39;m still a little uneasy about comments like &amp;quot;Certain Jews are equal opportunity embezzlers...&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Regarding those fiendish &amp;quot;certain Jews&amp;quot;, is it due to the genes of a certain Israelite tribe? The Danites? The Reubenites? Maybe it&amp;#39;s those treacherous Gadites, or is it due to the genetic descendants of the Levitical priesthood who bear the surname &amp;#39;Cohen&amp;#39;.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;One rarely hears, if ever, such comments as &amp;quot;certain Brits are equal opportunity embezzlers&amp;quot;, or &amp;quot;pay strict attention to certain Chinese, for they are equal opportunity swindlers&amp;quot; or the universal admonition to be on the lookout for &amp;quot;certain Buddhists who are equal opportunity cheats and liars who are known to have treated co-religionists and foreigners with equal guile and contempt.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;I certainly don&amp;#39;t deny that many Jewish people have committed heinous crimes against persons and property, and I don&amp;#39;t deny that the Israeli leadership is corrupt, but this can be generally said about other ethnic groups and their government leadership as well. It&amp;#39;s as if those Hebrews, as characterized by the ethno-centrically fixated Zionist watchdogs, have some kind of preternatural monopoly on all that is unholy and evil. What is it about &amp;quot;the Jews&amp;quot; that elicits such disproportionate responses above and beyond all other ethnic groups? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I suppose I may be a tad bit too sensitive, but &amp;#39;Group Think&amp;#39; and the collectivist mindset, whether based on economic class or race, has become -how did Will Grigg once word it- a pestiferous  &lt;br /&gt;irritation between my teeth and gums. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;P.S. Another &amp;quot;clear sighted and honest Jew&amp;quot; -I know; it&amp;#39;s extremely rare. Right?- is Benjamin Ginsberg who wrote the insightful tome entitled &amp;quot;The Fatal Embrace: The Jews And The State&amp;quot;. I recommend it....unless, for some inexplicable reason, you don&amp;#39;t trust me. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;-Ari Weidenfeld&lt;br /&gt; Seattle,WA</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/4255028071878448967'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/4255028071878448967'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247532288012#c4255028071878448967' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-718028579"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 13, 2009 at 6:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8812368728078815469</id><published>2009-07-13T17:32:57.232-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-13T17:32:57.232-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m not sure that the objective behind the sha...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m not sure that the objective behind the shake-down was to bring about a new Swiss constitution and the end of the franc&amp;#39;s link to gold. What happened, as I understand it, was that the blackmail demands caused the Swiss government to de-monetize a quantity of its gold reserves, and then Gresham&amp;#39;s Law took over.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/8812368728078815469'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/8812368728078815469'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247527977232#c8812368728078815469' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 13, 2009 at 5:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-945861486054526165</id><published>2009-07-13T17:01:55.307-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-13T17:01:55.307-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I read part of The Holocaust Industry that concern...</title><content type='html'>I read part of &lt;i&gt;The Holocaust Industry&lt;/i&gt; that concerned Switzerland by using Amazon’s “Search Inside” feature and reread the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mail-archive.com/ctrl@listserv.aol.com/msg19932.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt; provided in this essay but I don’t understand how blackmailing billions from Switzerland led to (1) the abandonment of the Swiss franc’s tie to gold, and (2) the Swiss revising their constitution to make the severance of francs to gold permanent.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/945861486054526165'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/945861486054526165'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247526115307#c945861486054526165' title=''/><author><name>I Hate Bobby Flay</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1404657108"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 13, 2009 at 5:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-80184631433034361</id><published>2009-07-13T02:19:07.297-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-13T02:19:07.297-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Every reader of this site should get a copy of, an...</title><content type='html'>Every reader of this site should get a copy of, and read the book &amp;quot;The Holocaust Industry&amp;quot; by Jewish author Norman G. Finkelstein, whose mother is an Auschwitz survivor and has the tattoo on her arm to prove it. Out of the $80 billion or so in reparations paid by the German Government to Israel and various Holocuast survivor organizations, his mother has received only about $1,000. This is the editorial review of Finkelstein&amp;#39;s book from Amazon.com:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;===================================&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;This iconoclastic study was one of the most widely debated books of 2000. Finkelstein indicts with both vigor and honesty those who exploit the tragedy of the Holocaust for their own personal political and financial gain. In a devastating new postscript to this best-selling book, Norman G. Finkelstein documents the Holocaust industry&amp;#39;s scandalous cover-up of the blackmail of Swiss banks, and in a new appendix demolishes an influential apologia for the Holocaust industry. &lt;br /&gt;In an iconoclastic and controversial new study, Norman G. Finkelstein moves from an interrogation of the place the Holocaust has come to occupy in American culture to a disturbing examination of recent Holocaust compensation agreements. It was not until the Arab-Israeli War of 1967, when Israel&amp;#39;s evident strength brought it into line with US foreign policy, that memory of the Holocaust began to acquire the exceptional prominence it enjoys today. Leaders of America&amp;#39;s Jewish community were delighted that Israel was now deemed a major strategic asset and, Finkelstein contends, exploited the Holocaust to enhance this newfound status. Their subsequent interpretations of the tragedy are often at variance with actual historical events and are employed to deflect any criticism of Israel and its supporters. Recalling Holocaust fraudsters such as Jerzy Kosinski and Binjamin Wilkomirski, as well as the demagogic constructions of writers like Daniel Goldhagen, Finkelstein contends that the main danger posed to the memory of Nazism&amp;#39;s victims comes not from the distortions of Holocaust deniers but from prominent, self-proclaimed guardians of Holocaust memory. Drawing on a wealth of untapped sources, he exposes the double shakedown of European countries as well as legitimate Jewish claimants, and concludes that the Holocaust industry has become an outright extortion racket. Thoroughly researched and closely argued, The Holocaust Industry is all the more disturbing and powerful because the issues it deals with are so rarely discussed.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;==================================&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All those tens of billions have disappeared into lavish institutional salaries for wives and girlfriends and children of the principal professional whiners and coprogenetics in the Jewish Holocaust Industry, into study trips to Tahiti to assess how non-Holocaust survivors live, into infrastructure for Jewish settlements in the Palestinian territories, and into arms for the settlers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In case there was any doubt in anyone&amp;#39;s mind, the Bernie Madoff saga has confirmed the thesis of this book: Certain Jews are equal-opportunity embezzlers: They will steal from their own people just as readily as from non-Jews, even from their own mothers, children, widows, orphans, the sick, and the poor.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I read recently that a survey was done this year in 60 countries, to find out which country was viewed as the most corrupt by its OWN citizens. The hands-down winner: Israel.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;At least SOME Jews have a clear-sighted and honest view of their own people. However, the luxury of an honest opinion is denied to non-Jews, such as Jimmy Carter, Desmond Tutu, John Mearsheimer, and Stephen Walt.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/80184631433034361'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/80184631433034361'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247473147297#c80184631433034361' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2078107981"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 13, 2009 at 2:19 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8296398104102266092</id><published>2009-07-11T18:27:01.134-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-11T18:27:01.134-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Coprogenetic&amp;quot; to describe Edgar Bronfma...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Coprogenetic&amp;quot; to describe Edgar Bronfman.  Good one, Will.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/8296398104102266092'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/8296398104102266092'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247358421134#c8296398104102266092' title=''/><author><name>Alan Rock Waterman</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04971243364867111868</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_t_2XchnR2mA/SbI4mDLzz4I/AAAAAAAAAAo/bo556nShT70/S220/Finepix+2008-49.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1357789457"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 11, 2009 at 6:27 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3249189807619254040</id><published>2009-07-11T16:09:18.388-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-11T16:09:18.388-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I learned everything I needed to know about gun ri...</title><content type='html'>I learned everything I needed to know about gun rights during my time in Switzerland.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/3249189807619254040'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/3249189807619254040'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247350158388#c3249189807619254040' title=''/><author><name>Scott</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15979653958648881988</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2140908340"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 11, 2009 at 4:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5662267798398559618</id><published>2009-07-11T14:28:53.876-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-11T14:28:53.876-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Watch out, Team Switzerland, you’re probably next....</title><content type='html'>&lt;b&gt;Watch out, Team Switzerland, you’re probably next.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Recently I watched the World Pastry Team Championship on Food Network, a prestigious international contest to see which country can create the most sensational sugar and chocolate masterpieces. It was held in the US and some of the countries represented were France (duh), Germany, Japan, South Korea, Mexico, Switzerland, and Belgium. All the teams bring their own equipment to use in these contests, but this year (2008?) we were told that Japan would be working with a distinct disadvantage, having to use all new equipment. Why, oh &lt;b&gt;WHY&lt;/b&gt; couldn’t Team Japan compete with the equipment they brought? What disaster had befallen them? The announcer said only that it was because of a TSA “debacle.” &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I can’t find anything by googling, so I can only guess that Team Japan’s equipment was confiscated by the TSA and destroyed. That sounds plausible. Wasn’t there a famous pianist who traveled all over the world with his own Baby Grand, that is, until he tried to sneak it into the US, whereupon the TSA had to destroy it because it smelled funny?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/5662267798398559618'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/5662267798398559618'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247344133876#c5662267798398559618' title=''/><author><name>I Hate Bobby Flay</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1404657108"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 11, 2009 at 2:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2096259567858311113</id><published>2009-07-11T00:16:45.879-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-11T00:16:45.879-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Lemuel Gulliver had written:&#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;My Swiss host ...</title><content type='html'>Lemuel Gulliver had written:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;My Swiss host also explained that his 2 clips of ammunition were sealed, and had to be inspected each year when he went for his 2 weeks of reserve camp. If a seal was broken, he would be in big, big trouble, and have to explain how that happened.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What you didn&amp;#39;t apparently learn is that the Swiss military makes available large stocks of surplus &amp;quot;expired-but-shootable&amp;quot; ammunition for all those issue assault rifles, as well as for the older semiautomatic (non-selective-fire) military long arms and pistols sold out of Army inventory over the years, and does so freely and cheaply.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This puts lots of ammunition into the hands of the Swiss private citizenry, both Militia members and those without any formal affiliation with the military services.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Swiss not only keep all those weapons in their homes but get a lot of familiarity with them.  The sealed ammunition boxes are for &amp;quot;official&amp;quot; use, but the Militia member is encouraged to take his piece down to the firing range as often as possible, and get plenty of practice with it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/2096259567858311113'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/2096259567858311113'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247293005879#c2096259567858311113' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-942688544"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 11, 2009 at 12:16 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5075460143548450098</id><published>2009-07-11T00:00:59.862-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-11T00:00:59.862-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;throw of Bonaparte&amp;#39;s yoke&amp;quot;&#xa;&#xa;*off</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;throw of Bonaparte&amp;#39;s yoke&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;*off</content><link re