.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247287767140#c1408158754526158387' title=''/><author><name>traitor2tyranny</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1290487802"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 10, 2009 at 10:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5286422991861261673</id><published>2009-07-10T20:36:30.344-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-10T20:36:30.344-06:00</updated><title type='text'>William Tell...what an awesome guy.</title><content type='html'>William Tell...what an awesome guy.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/5286422991861261673'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/5286422991861261673'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247279790344#c5286422991861261673' title=''/><author><name>James the Syrian</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1891369117"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 10, 2009 at 8:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-969116713474026557</id><published>2009-07-10T16:48:46.072-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-10T16:48:46.072-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;d like to emigrate to Switzerland, but I&amp;#39...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;d like to emigrate to Switzerland, but I&amp;#39;m afraid they wouldn&amp;#39;t take us in......we are, after all, (ugh) Amerikans.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/969116713474026557'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/969116713474026557'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247266126072#c969116713474026557' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-718028579"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 10, 2009 at 4:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8827901511550199819</id><published>2009-07-10T02:19:04.796-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-10T02:19:04.796-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I second that request for access to .mp3 archives ...</title><content type='html'>I second that request for access to .mp3 archives of your radio show! (like Lew Rockwell does :-) ...Bonus would be if I could get the &amp;quot;Liberty Minute&amp;quot; collection as well! Keep speaking and writing the truth Mr. Grigg!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/8827901511550199819'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/8827901511550199819'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247213944796#c8827901511550199819' title=''/><author><name>QB</name><uri>http://www.thehistoryofearth.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-146012794"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 10, 2009 at 2:19 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4332441903498495752</id><published>2009-07-09T23:57:23.286-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-09T23:57:23.286-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;&#xa;Very good essay as always.  I just fin...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Very good essay as always.  I just finished reading &amp;quot;Liberty in Eclipse&amp;quot; and it was very good as well.  I was wondering though if your radio program was archived anywhere, and if so, where I could get it.  If it is not archived, then I will be the first to make the request.  I have alot of free time in which I would like to listen, but unfortunately it is usually not at 6 oclock.  Thank you for all that you do.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Josh</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/4332441903498495752'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/4332441903498495752'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247205443286#c4332441903498495752' title=''/><author><name>Josh Parris</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08412892387498489410</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-880820851"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 9, 2009 at 11:57 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7004393798051898402</id><published>2009-07-09T20:54:56.933-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-09T20:54:56.933-06:00</updated><title type='text'>A wonderful article, as usual, Will!  However, I w...</title><content type='html'>A wonderful article, as usual, Will!  However, I wish you wouldn&amp;#39;t tell too many people about Switzerland.  We can&amp;#39;t all escape there.  :)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/7004393798051898402'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/7004393798051898402'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html?showComment=1247194496933#c7004393798051898402' title=''/><author><name>Tom Mullen</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01560337910390558259</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_zIW64_kPcuY/SLlbG-xS-OI/AAAAAAAAAAM/O5OHLjD9Xl0/S220/Hub+Pic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/07/beware-william-tells-second-arrow.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4836820501302629041' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4836820501302629041' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1522644678"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 9, 2009 at 8:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7964775964316540786</id><published>2009-07-09T20:38:06.598-06:00</published><updated>2009-07-09T20:38:06.598-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Francessnoot&#xa;How does focusing on creating/sustain...</title><content type='html'>Francessnoot&lt;br /&gt;How does focusing on creating/sustaining a profit constitute a soulless act?&lt;br /&gt;I run a business of my own and I have found over  the years that a bleeding heart of benevolence hardly pays the bills.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4836820501302629041/comments/default/796